<title>HONG KONG: Tungtex interim profit jumps 98.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Tungtex interim profit jumps 98.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.0	 vs  2.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.25	vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  3.36 loss vs  4.75 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    18.30     vs  9.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     460.47    vs  429.34</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tungtex (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 16-22</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 29</p>
<p>NOTE - Tungtex (Holdings) is an investment holding company with subsidiaries involved in the manufacture of high fashion clothing, fabric and clothing accessories as well as fashion design and retailing. Net is after an exceptional loss due to a loss and exhange reserve realised from the sale of associated companies.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
